   {
    "h": "Geographic range",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "In Australia, A. guentheri is found in the state of Western Australia and in Northern Territory."
    ]
   },
   {
    "h": "Habitat",
    "level": 2,
    "paras": [
     "The preferred natural habitat of A. guentheri is grassland."
    ]
